      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should `led_id` be part of `led_patterns`? `led_pattern_node_t` already defines the patterns to display for a single led via the array `pattern_color`.\n\nIs `led_id` a physical index, or a virtual id exposed to the AP?\n\nWith this structure, we can define pattern for several LEDs (each in one `led_pattern_node_t`. Therefore the led_id should be there.",
