      "side": 1,
      "message": "This `led_id` is an existing enum. It is used to skip the build-in patterns, while other side LEDs with a different `led_id` (e.g., `EC_LED_ID_BATTERY_LED`) will continue. In the host command case, it is always `EC_LED_ID_LIGHTBAR_LED`.",
